    <profile name="Vigil Pattern Storm Shield" id="67ae3255-7245-4f31-4997-ee38d71956b7" hidden="false" page="97" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187" typeId="57617267656172204974656d23232344415441232323" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">Confers  3+ Invulnerable save, but user may never claim the bonus attack for having 2 close combat weapons.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Explorator Augury Web" id="4f11-6d06-0540-0375" hidden="false" page="219" publicationId="ca571888--pubN66500" typeId="57617267656172204974656d23232344415441232323" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">At the start of the controlling player&apos;s turn, prior to any reserve rolls, declare which mode is being used - it remains until their next player turn.  Disruption Mode: the oppsoing player suffers -1 to their reserve rolls.  Relay Mode: Owning player&apos;s reserve rolls may be re-rolled, whether successful or not.  Reduces transport capacity to 8.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
