        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">Saturnine Terminator armour affords a +2 armour save and a 5+ Invulnerable save. No Run moves.
Units containing more than 25% Carapace Weapon Heavy Bolters and Autocannons (combined) become Heavy Support Choices. THIS IS NOT ENFORCED BY BATTLESCRIBE (YET)</characteristic>
