                  <rules>
                    <rule name="Sabatoge!" id="54eaabc9-d89a-048a-fc05-e5f184ccdd19" hidden="false" page="21" publicationId="ca571888--pubN80998">
                      <description>Sabotage! – After both sides have deployed, but before the first game turn, select a single enemy unit or fortification on the table (not an Independent Character.) That unit suffers D6 Str 5 AP 6 hits. Targets are struck against their weakest Armour value. Casualties are allocated by the opposing player and do not cause Morale checks. A single Sabotage! attack may be made for each Vigilator in the force. If both sides possess them, roll off to determine which side’s attacks go first.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
