      <rules>
        <rule name="Sire of the Iron Hands" id="b40a-1a0b-ec18-b706" hidden="false" page="53" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>Has the Relentless and Smash special rules. All shooting attacks against him suffer -1 penalty to their strength.

All models in an army with Ferrus Manus with Legions Astartes (Iron Hands) gain Feel No Pain 6 unless they already have a superior version of this rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Master of Mechanisms" id="c976-4d26-cc0e-3140" hidden="false" page="53" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>Has the Battlesmith rule and passes repair checks on a 3.  In addition, any vehicles in a detachment with Ferrus Manus with at least one armour value of 13 or higher gain It Will Not Die.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
