      <rules>
        <rule name="Death Cloud" id="f31b-7934-a3dd-c1f4" hidden="false">
          <description>The Death Cloud means that any unit with a Toughness characteristic charging an unengaged unit will be forced into making a Disordered Charge while doing so. In addition, the Death Cloud can be used as a weapon with the following profile, and may also be used to make Overwatch Attacks, contrary to the usual limitations of Cataphractii Terminator armour.</description>
        </rule>
