        <rule name="Fatal Strike" id="91a67c2a-6a9a-d9b7-2a14-a79d9b60b59a" hidden="false" page="106" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>One per game, unit may execute a Fatal Strike against a chosen target.  Declared at the start of the shooting phase, the unit&apos;s shooting attacks gain Twin-linked and Rending. With Sniper Rifles, rending increases to a 5 instead of 6.</description>
