      <rules>
        <rule name="Raptor Strike" id="d4af-61e0-fa3c-f3c6" hidden="false" page="182" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0">
          <description>A model with this special rule may use a Jump pack in both the Movement phase and the Assault phase of the same turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Bloody Murder" id="caff-0ad5-1bab-14c5" hidden="false" page="182" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0">
          <description>After all normal attacks by the squad have been resolved, count the number of enemy models removed as casualties as a result of those attacks. Immediately resolve a number of automatic wounds with AP - equal to the number of casulties casued on any one enemy unit is locked in combat with (note that this has no effect on vehicles). These additional wounds do not themselves inflict more wounds.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
