        <profile name="Precision Bombardment" id="7f45-af7f-e626-d645" hidden="false" page="87" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187" typeId="576561706f6e23232344415441232323" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="52616e676523232344415441232323">Unlimited</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="537472656e67746823232344415441232323">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="4.1502323234441545e+23">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="5.479706523232345e+27">Ordnance D3, Barrage, Large Blast, Twin-linked</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Wrist Cannon" id="ca06-70a5-03d2-60ea" hidden="false" page="87" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187" typeId="576561706f6e23232344415441232323" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="52616e676523232344415441232323">24&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="537472656e67746823232344415441232323">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="4.1502323234441545e+23">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="5.479706523232345e+27">Assault 3, Twin-linked, Rending</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Sire of the Iron Warriors" id="0720-8fb8-b6bd-9318" hidden="false" page="87" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>All Perturabo&apos;s attacks have Wrecker and Tank Hunters.  Additionally, while Perturabo is on the table all models with Legiones Astartes (Iron Warriors) gain Stubborn</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Relentless Strategist" id="99f5-5dd1-3616-161a" hidden="false" page="87" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>All models in the same army as Perturabo gain Furious Charge while in the enemy&apos;s deployment zone.  Additionally, an army with Perturabo as the warlord may begin rolling for reserves on turn 1 if wished.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Precision Bombarment" id="3706-cbcb-f75c-fe42" hidden="false" page="87" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>Unless engaged in close combat or in reserve, Perturabo may call down a Precision Bombardment attack in the shooting phase once per game. Line of sight for this attack must be drawn from him or any friendly model equipped with a Nuncio-vox or Cortex Controller.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="The Logos" id="6a94-7d8d-607f-f992" hidden="false" page="87" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>Provides the following:

- 2 armour and 3+ Invulnerable save
- Close combat attacks using Perturabo&apos;s profile and AP value of 2
- Immunity to Concussive and Blind
- Wrist Cannon
- Deep strike special rule for himself and any Terminator-armoured units (of any type) with the Legiones Astartes (Iron Warriors)
- The following wargear:
---Teleport Transponder
---Cortex Controller
---Nuncio-vox
---Cognis Signum</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
