          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">A Leviathan Dreadnought has a 4+ Invulnerable save. In addition, if the Leviathan suffers a Vehicle Explodes damage result, add D3 Str and D3&quot; to the radius of the blast.</characteristic>
