              <rules>
                <rule name="Graviton Wave" id="bfd3-b172-5e52-18df" hidden="false">
                  <description>Instead of rolling To Wound with this weapon, any non-vehicle model caught in its effect must instead roll equal to or under their Strength on a D6 or suffer a wound (a roll of a ‘6’ always counts as a failure). In addition, any unit which suffers a Morale check as a result of
casualties taken from this attack is subject to a -2 Ld modifier.</description>
