      <rules>
        <rule name="Master of the Shattered Legions" id="189b-bd09-b36d-ad38" hidden="false" publicationId="ca571888--pubN89821">
          <description>Shadrak Meduson has the Master of the LEgion special rule, and in addition to Iron Hands Rites of War may select Rites unitque to Raven Guard and Salamanders Legions, counting as having the requisite version of the LEgiones Astartes special rule for the purpose of its effects and limitations. Shadrak Meduson may only gain the benefit of this special rule when acting as part of an army created using the Shattered Legions Theme.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
