        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="355"/>
      </costs>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Deep Strike" id="8f35-6645-5d85-95f9" hidden="false" targetId="d219-2314-4834-c054" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink name="Fearless" id="13f9-6d40-01af-78a9" hidden="false" targetId="dc70-e199-5525-e78c" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <modifiers>
        <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
          <conditions>
            <condition childId="edd3-79ac-eb75-34b7" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Cor&apos;bax Utterblight" id="7a0c-1f05-c2ef-a4d0" hidden="false" publicationId="8700-b3bb-pubN77868" typeId="556e697423232344415441232323" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="556e6974205479706523232344415441232323">Monstrous Creature (Character)</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="5.753232323444154e+23">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="4.2532323234441546e+23">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="5.323232344415441e+21">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="5.423232344415441e+21">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="5.723232344415441e+21">7</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="4.923232344415441e+21">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="4.123232344415441e+21">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="4c4423232344415441232323">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save" typeId="5.361766523232344e+27">-</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Slime Trail" id="54e3-b8e8-d81d-2ec8" hidden="false" page="0">
          <description>A successful charge against units with this special rule is always a disordered charge.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Gaping Maw" id="e8ec-530e-4bf7-a0cc" hidden="false" publicationId="8700-b3bb-pubN77868">
          <description>Cor’bax’s vast maw opens wide enough to swallow enemies whole. When fighting against infantry models, any To Hit rolls of 5 or 6 made in the Assault phase by Cor’bax have the Instant Death special rule. Roll to wound and save with these attacks separately.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Noisome Tide of Flesh" id="fd0b-61cf-36b3-5b67" hidden="false" publicationId="8700-b3bb-pubN77868">
          <description>Cor’bax Utterblight’s corporeal form is little more than a mass of roiling gelatinous and pestilential flesh, which makes him even harder to harm than many of his Daemon kin and allows him to seethe across the battlefield like a destroying tide of plague.

Cor’bax Utterblight inflicts D3 Hammer of Wrath hits when charging. He ignores all dangerous terrain and difficult terrain. He counts as being armed with assault grenades when charging. In addition, if he is destroyed replace his model with the Massive Blast (7&quot;) template. All models under the template that do not have the Daemon of Nurgle special rule suffer a single Poisoned (4) AP 4 hit.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Poisoned (3)" id="ccf0-e6b1-7f3f-f969" hidden="false"/>
        <rule name="Pskyer (Mastery Level 2)" id="07b0-f9e1-a039-e096" hidden="false">
          <description>Cor’bax Utterblight may generate his powers from either the Plague or Biomancy disciplines.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
