      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="The Last Warlord" id="0109-a5a5-52ce-63d4" hidden="false" page="70" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>If Cassian Dracos is the only HQ selection in your army, he becomes the warlord.  Uses his specific Warlord Trait.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Burning Wrath" id="d908-d49c-3676-0996" hidden="false" page="70" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>May forfeit his normal number of close combat attacks to inflict one automatic S6 AP4 hit at initiative 1 on every model in base contact, friendlies included.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Dreadfire Heavy Flamers" id="2046-9a6a-ea58-3030" hidden="false" page="70" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>Inbuilt to Dracos&apos; two Dreadnought Close Combat Weapons, they may be fired either as two inividual Heavy Flamers, or as a single Twin-linked Meltagun. Must be chosen at the beginning of the shooting phase.  If one of the Heavy Flamers is destroyed, this optional rule may not be used. These do benefit from the Promethean Gift special rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Warlord: Fires of Martyrdom" id="d2fe-4a0c-161d-d124" hidden="false">
          <description>If Cassian Dracos is your army’s Warlord then your opponent cannot score Victory points for the Slay the Warlord secondary objective. In addition, all models from your
detachment with the Legiones Astartes (Salamanders) special rule within 3&quot; of Cassian Dracos gain the Feel No Pain (5) special rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Wrought by Vulkan" id="177a-a41a-2bc1-ddeb" hidden="false">
          <description>Immune to effects of Melta, Armourbane, Sunder, and Lance rules.  Any other rules which reduce or permantly degrade his Armour or allow attacks targeting him to roll more than one dice when making Armour penetration rolls have no effect.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
