        <rule name="Born Survivor" id="8b05-04ba-3690-f9d6" hidden="false" page="17" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>The first time Loken is removed as a casualty, roll a D6.  On a 2 he lives on with a single wound remaining.  This rule can only be used once per battle.</description>
