      <rules>
        <rule name="Warlord: Raise the Storm" id="f216-6d6a-e2cf-8c1b" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per game, at the beginning ofMeduson&apos;s controlling player&apos;s turn, they may declare the use of this special rule. Until the beginning of their next player turn, all models in their army with the Legions Astartes (Iron Hands), (Raven Guard) or (Salamanders) special rule gain Furious Charge, Hatred and Crusader.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
