        <rule name="Warlord&apos;s Pride" id="3f92-cefb-840f-076a" hidden="false" page="34" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>If Eidolon is a part of the army, he will always be the warlord unless Fulgrim is present. He does not roll on the Warlord Traits table, but instead uses his own unique trait.</description>
        </rule>
