      <rules>
        <rule name="Warlord&apos;s Pride" id="b10f-d869-a321-6802" hidden="false" page="34" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>If Kharn is a part of the army, he will always be the warlord unless Angron is present.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Savage Assualt" id="954e-93a6-bbdd-7293" hidden="false">
          <description>If Khârn is the army’s Warlord then his side gains 1 to any random roll to determine which side gets the first turn, and also to Seize the Initiative if this is a feature of the mission being played.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
