      <profiles>
        <profile name="Kaedes Nex" id="97fc-f70e-b1b6-4cd0" hidden="false" page="110" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187" typeId="556e697423232344415441232323" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="556e6974205479706523232344415441232323">Infantry (Character)</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="5.753232323444154e+23">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="4.2532323234441546e+23">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="5.323232344415441e+21">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="5.423232344415441e+21">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="5.723232344415441e+21">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="4.923232344415441e+21">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="4.123232344415441e+21">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="4c4423232344415441232323">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save" typeId="5.361766523232344e+27">3+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Relentless Stalker" id="9ad5-ef26-2e82-f4a2" hidden="false" page="110" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>During deployment, select on enemy Elite or HQ choice as Kaedes Nex&apos;s chosen prey.  Instead of deploying normally, Nex may be placed after all other infiltrators anywhere within 18&quot; of his chosen target as long as he remains out of sight of all enemy units, gaining Shrouded for the first turn of play.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="The Raven&apos;s Vengeance" id="53d5-e94d-07b6-0037" hidden="false" page="110" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>When in combat with his chosen prey, Nex gains the Zealot rule.  If the unit is destroyed in close combat where Kaedes Nex is involved, or during a shooting phase in which he inflicted one or more wounds on the unit, an additional VP is scored for the Raven Guard.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Ill-omened" id="e589-958e-1192-e971" hidden="false" page="110" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>May not be chosen as an army&apos;s compulsory HQ and may may not be the warlord.  May not join units of any kind during deployment or during the game.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Gunfighter" id="541f-2ae9-92d1-d124" hidden="false" page="110" publicationId="ca571888--pubN113187">
          <description>May use his Fulcrum hand-cannons profile in close combat.  He gains 1 attack for having two close-combat weapons.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
