        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="The Bloody Aegis" id="0fc6-3c9b-6db6-11dd" hidden="false" page="189" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0">
          <description>Increases Ophion&apos;s invulnerable save to 3+ in close combat.  In addition, any model that targets Ophion with one or more attacks in an assault and scores an unmodified 1 on at least one of those dice, has its WS halved when targeted by any of Ophion&apos;s close combat attacks until the beginning of the next Game Turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="The Coward" id="855c-ba1a-2c1a-c2ff" hidden="false" page="189" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0">
          <description>Once Ophion has lost a single wound, he gains Feel No Pain (4+).  When reduced to a single wound remaining, upgraded to Feel No Pain (3+).</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Warlord: Aberrant Bravery" id="c50d-3c0d-01ab-5454" hidden="false" page="189" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0">
          <description>If Kheron Ophion is the army&apos;s warlord then as long as Ophion&apos;s controlling player has less Victory points than their opponent, Ophion and any Night Lords units within 12&apos;&apos; of him gain the Stubborn special rule. Additionally, the controlling player may always choose to re-roll, or have his opponent re-roll, any failed dice roll to determine if the game continues for another turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
