      <rules>
        <rule name="The Revenant&apos;s Pawn" id="ab6c-7782-58c1-73df" hidden="false" page="253" publicationId="ca571888--pubN89821">
          <description>May be included in any army that has either Cassian Dracos or Xiaphas Jurr as its Warlord.  Dreygur retains his Legiones Astartes (Iron Warriors) rule and while within 12&quot; of Cassian Dracos gains Zealot and Rage.  Additionally, when included in an army alongside Cassian Dracos or Xiaphas Jurr, you may include an additional unit of Legion Veterans with the Legiones Astartes (Iron Warriors) rule that do not use up a Force Organization slot and does not count towards any minimum required units.  Both Narik Dreygur and this unit of Veterans are treated as Desperate Allies by all other friendly units other than Cassian Dracos and Xiaphas Jurr.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
