            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="5.479706523232345e+27">Melee, Rending</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Virtue of Judgement" id="e94a-c514-2304-f5a2" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of the game, after deployment but before the first turn is declared, roll a D3. After Crohne&apos;s controlling player may select a number of enemy units equal to the number rolled to be marked by the Angel&apos;s Wrath. Whenever Crohne or a Destroyers of Angel&apos;s Tears unit is used to make a Shooting attack against a unit marked with the Angel&apos;s Wrath, his hand flamer attacks are made with the Shred and Rending special rules.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="The Ghost of Saiph" id="559a-3571-2d1b-ddb5" hidden="false">
          <description>The first time Aster Crohne is reduces to 0 Wounds, or otherwise removed from play by any effect or attack, roll a D6. On a 4+, he is placed in Ongoing Reserves with a single Wound remaining instead of being removed or destroyed. If he enters Ongoing Reserves on or after turn 4, then may may enter play automatically at the start of the controlling player&apos;s following turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
