      <rules>
        <rule name="Those Once Honoured" id="60b6-792b-88d4-5d33" hidden="false">
          <description>A Dominator Cohort may be chosen instead of a Command Squad as a bodyguard for Perturabo. If selected in this manner they count as a Retintue unit and do not use up a separate Force Organisation slot, but no other Retinue unit may be selected for Perturabo. All model in a Dominator Cohort selected in this manner lose the Hatred (Cybernetica Cortex) and instead gain the Feel No Pain (6+) special rule. In adition, if an army includes a Domitar Cohort selected as a retinue for Perturabo, then the army may not include any &apos;Iron Circle&apos; Domitar-ferrum class battle-automata maniple units.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
